{
  "schema": 1,
  "desktopContract": 1,
  "about": "What an installed Namzu Desktop application relies on from this command line, read from packages/desktop/src. Guarded by src/desktop-contract.test.ts; explained in docs/sdk/kernel-facts.md. A change that removes or renames a name below, or changes a recorded shape in a way an installed application rejects, raises DESKTOP_CONTRACT. An addition an older application ignores only needs the new value recorded here.",
  "rule": "Breaking for an already installed application: raise DESKTOP_CONTRACT (packages/cli/src/desktop-contract.ts) and record the new number here. Additive: record the new value here and say why in the same commit.",
